  {
   "id": "sec1-9",
   "section": "Biography",
   "text": "Jafar Agha along with Ahmet Agha, commanded Kurdish regiments in the Russo-Turkish war of 1828-1829 and the Crimean war, under the supervision of Captain Loris Melikov.",
